<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 592.93, up 1.45.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 302 to 252.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.04.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 24,181,900, compared with 10,918,060 in Friday's abbreviated session.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
</text>
